WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.916
Episode seven: the happy path.

2
00:00:01.916 --> 00:00:06.324
The technician submits the report for review, and the CRM accepts it.

3
00:00:06.676 --> 00:00:08.608
First the technician saves a draft.

4
00:00:08.608 --> 00:00:10.486
Then they press Submit for review.

5
00:00:10.837 --> 00:00:13.351
The status at the top changes to Review.

6
00:00:13.351 --> 00:00:14.796
The CRM has the report.

7
00:00:15.147 --> 00:00:17.488
Submit for review is a workflow action.

8
00:00:17.488 --> 00:00:19.650
First it checks the required fields.

9
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:23.312
This button has none, so the list is empty and it carries on.

10
00:00:23.662 --> 00:00:25.415
The previous status is draft.

11
00:00:25.415 --> 00:00:28.862
It is kept in a variable, in case we need to put it back.

12
00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:32.429
Then the status changes to review, before anything is sent,

13
00:00:32.429 --> 00:00:35.029
so the report goes out with its new status.

14
00:00:35.381 --> 00:00:38.478
The page’s onWorkflow callback calls form.

15
00:00:38.478 --> 00:00:39.141
submit().

16
00:00:39.141 --> 00:00:42.607
We are online, so it does not go to the outbox.

17
00:00:42.607 --> 00:00:45.482
It sends a POST to /api/startup-report.

18
00:00:45.833 --> 00:00:47.581
The answer comes back.

19
00:00:47.581 --> 00:00:49.249
Status 200, response.

20
00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:51.950
ok is true, so no error is thrown.

21
00:00:52.302 --> 00:00:53.487
Now the saved draft.

22
00:00:53.487 --> 00:00:56.984
It was saved before this report was made, so it is deleted.

23
00:00:56.984 --> 00:01:01.074
If the technician had saved again after submitting, it would be kept.

24
00:01:01.425 --> 00:01:05.827
Finally, onSubmitSuccess tells the page, with the CRM’s answer.

25
00:01:06.179 --> 00:01:07.757
That is the whole happy path.

26
00:01:07.757 --> 00:01:10.369
Here it is again as a diagram in the code guide.

27
00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:13.015
To try this yourself, open sample.

28
00:01:13.015 --> 00:01:17.809
html, open DevTools, and set the same breakpoints in the Sources panel.

29
00:01:17.809 --> 00:01:20.577
Then do what we did, and step through it.
